Hi Scott,

I'm not really clear on the details of the simulation, so I can't really offer anything concrete about the phenomenon. If you're sure that it's not a software based problem (occurs across MULTILOG and Wingen) then maybe you can replicate the problem in R using functions like simdata()? That will give a clearer indication of what's going on, and should be easier to replicate on my end (I'm admittedly not fluent in stand-alone IRT programs). Cheers.

Phil

